</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><h3 data-path-to-node="11">🛠️ 手順2: HTMLコード（<code data-path-to-node="11" data-index-in-node="17">index.html</code>）に数行追加する</h3><p data-path-to-node="12">前回のHTMLの <code data-path-to-node="12" data-index-in-node="9">&lt;head&gt;</code> タグの中（<code data-path-to-node="12" data-index-in-node="21">&lt;title&gt;</code>のすぐ下など）に、以下の3行を貼り付けます。</p><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2126061339="" class="ng-tns-c2126061339-178 enable-luminous-code-block ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2126061339="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2126061339-178 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl8wMGRjZGIwYTM5NTM2NDY3IiwiY185MjE5MDhjNGM5YzIwMzhmIixudWxsLCJyY19hZmIyNWIxYjhlOWNiMDQxIixudWxsLG51bGwsImphIixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDEsMF1d" data-hveid="6" style="display: block;"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2126061339="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2126061339-178"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2126061339="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2126061339-178"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2126061339="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-emphasized-body-m ng-tns-c2126061339-178 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2126061339="" cla