s ng-tns-c543715647-129"><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="ng-tns-c543715647-129 tts ng-trigger ng-trigger-singleResponseEnter ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="single-draft-response-container ng-tns-c543715647-129"><!----></div></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-header-status ng-tns-c543715647-129"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-header-processing-state ng-tns-c543715647-129"></div></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="presented-response-container ng-tns-c543715647-129" jslog="283401;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="2"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c543715647-129"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" highlighttoaskhost="" class="response-content ng-tns-c543715647-129"><!----><!----><thinking-overlay _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c2753012568="" class="enable-luminous-fast-follows ng-star-inserted"><!----></thinking-overlay><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="model-response-label-announcer" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off"><!----><!----><h6 _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted" style="">Gemini の回答</h6><!----><!----></div><model-response-content _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c652860866=""><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c652860866="" class="model-response-text processing-state-visible ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c2289268078="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2289268078="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c2289268078="" _nghost-ng-c1066623981="" id="message-content-id-r_a21be345e70c67c7" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1066623981="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger" id="model-response-message-contentr_a21be345e70c67c7" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration:400ms; --fade-animation-function:ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0">大丈夫ですよ！難しく感じてしまうのはとても自然なことです。初めて見ると記号や英語がたくさん並んでいて大変そうに見えますよね。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">無理に難しい作業をしなくても大丈夫です。<b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="20">一番簡単で費用もかからない方法</b>で進めましょう！</p><p data-path-to-node="2">パソコンかスマートフォン、<b data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="13">今どちらでお使いでしょうか？</b>
お使いの環境に合わせて、一番簡単な手順をご案内しますね。</p><h3 data-path-to-node="4">💻 パソコンをお使いの場合</h3><p data-path-to-node="5">一番ラクな方法は、メモ帳を開いてペタッと貼り付けて保存するだけです！</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="6"><li><p data-path-to-node="6,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="6,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">画面のコードをコピーする</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="6,0,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="6,0,1,0,0">上の黒い枠（コード）の右上にある「コピー」ボタン（または文字）を押すか、文字を全部選んで「右クリック → コピー」します。</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="6,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="6,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">「メモ帳」を開く</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="6,1,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="6,1,1,0,0">Windowsなら「メモ帳」、Macなら「テキストエディタ」を開きます。</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="6,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="6,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">貼り付ける</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="6,2,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="6,2,1,0,0">メモ帳の中で「右クリック → 貼り付け」をします。</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="6,3,0"><b data-path-to-node="6,3,0" data-index-in-node="0">名前をつけて保存する</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="6,3,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="6,3,1,0,0">「名前をつけて保存」を選び、ファイル名を <code data-path-to-node="6,3,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="21">index.html</code> にして保存します。</p></li></ul></li></ol><h3 data-path-to-node="8">📱 スマートフォン（iPhone/Android）でお使いの場合</h3><p data-path-to-node="9">スマホだけでアプリにする場合は、もっと簡単なアプリ作成ツールや、そのまま動く共有ページを作る方法もあります！</p><p data-path-to-node="11">もし「自分でやるのがちょっと不安…」「この作業で止まっちゃった」というところがあれば、気兼ねなく教えてくださいね。ひとつずつゆっくり一緒にお手伝いします！</p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><!----></model-response-content><div _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="response-footer complete gap"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sources-list><!----><election-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c2531033441="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="display: none;"><!----></election-info-disclaimer><finance-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c1136367074="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="display: none;"><!----></finance-info-disclaimer><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c746442083="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c543715647-129 ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" footer="" class="hide-on-print ng-tns-c3896640774-130 hide-action-bar ng-tns-c543715647-129 ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c3896640774=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c3896640774="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c3896640774-130"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3896640774="" class="buttons-container-v2 ng-tns-c3896640774-130 ng-star-inserted"><!----><action-bar-buttons _ngcontent-ng-c3896640774="" _nghost-ng-c1559823796="" class="ng-tns-c3896640774-130 ng-star-inserted"><copy-button _ngcontent-ng-c1559823796="" _nghost-ng-c3634932602="" class="ng-star-inserted"><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c3634932602="" tabindex="-1" theme="lm" type="onSurface" arialabel="コピー" gemtooltip="回答をコピー" class="mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c1283807370="" aria-describedby="cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-9" cdk-describedby-host="ng-1"><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c1283807370="" maticonbutton="" matbadgeposition="after" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-badge mat-unthemed mat-badge-overlap mat-badge-above mat-badge-after mat-badge-small mat-badge-hidden ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" aria-label="コピー" jslog="178035;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl9hMjFiZTM0NWU3MGM2N2M3IiwiY185MjE5MDh