r-controls ng-tns-c543715647-133"><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="ng-tns-c543715647-133 tts ng-trigger ng-trigger-singleResponseEnter ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="single-draft-response-container ng-tns-c543715647-133"><!----></div></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-header-status ng-tns-c543715647-133"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-header-processing-state ng-tns-c543715647-133"></div></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="presented-response-container ng-tns-c543715647-133" jslog="283401;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="2"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c543715647-133"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" highlighttoaskhost="" class="response-content ng-tns-c543715647-133"><!----><!----><thinking-overlay _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c2753012568="" class="enable-luminous-fast-follows ng-star-inserted"><!----></thinking-overlay><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="model-response-label-announcer" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off"><!----><!----><h6 _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted" style="">Gemini の回答</h6><!----><!----></div><model-response-content _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c652860866=""><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c652860866="" class="model-response-text processing-state-visible ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c2289268078="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2289268078="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c2289268078="" _nghost-ng-c1066623981="" id="message-content-id-r_65ed96add05c84af" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1066623981="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger" id="model-response-message-contentr_65ed96add05c84af" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration:400ms; --fade-animation-function:ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0"><b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="0">「1・2・3」は全部やって大丈夫です！</b>
1つだけを選ぶという意味ではなく、順番に 1 ➔ 2 ➔ 3 と進めていく「お料理のレシピのようなステップ（手順）」になります！</p><p data-path-to-node="1">わかりづらくて混乱させてしまい、ごめんなさい！</p><h3 data-path-to-node="3">💡 1・2・3の流れ（順番に進めます）</h3><ul data-path-to-node="4"><li><p data-path-to-node="4,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="4,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">【1】パソコンからネットに載せる</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="4,0,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="4,0,1,0,0" id="p-rc_c5b31154167776b9-19"><span class="citation-1 citation-end-1">パソコンで作ったファイルを、ネット（Netlify Drop）に引っ張って載せます。<source-footnote ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c4211434500=""><sup _ngcontent-ng-c4211434500="" class="superscript" data-turn-source-index="1"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c2872110962="">   <!----><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c2872110962="" _nghost-ng-c3110763459="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3110763459="" class="source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c3110763459="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button multiple-button ng-star-inserted" aria-label="Netlify からの引用のソースの詳細を表示します。Enter キーを押すとソース ダイアログが開きます。" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" jslog="262206;track:generic_click;BardVeMetadataKey:"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3110763459="" dir="auto" class="source-label-container gds-body-s ng-star-inserted"><span _ngcontent-ng-c3110763459="" class="source-title" style="max-width: 20ch;">Netlify</span><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="4,0,1,1,0">載せると、スマホで開くための「専用URL（ホームページの住所）」がもらえます。</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="4,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="4,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">【2】そのURLをスマホに送る</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="4,1,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="4,1,1,0,0">【1】でもらったURLを、ご自身のスマホ（LINEやメールなど）に送って、スマホで開きます。</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="4,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="4,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">【3】スマホのホーム画面にアイコンを追加する</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="4,2,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="4,2,1,0,0">スマホで開いた画面で「ホーム画面に追加」を押すと、スマホにピンクとオレンジの「介護パートナー」のアイコンがポンッと登場します！</p></li></ul></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="6">ひとつずつ順番にやれば絶対にできますので、まずは <b data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="25">「1」</b> からゆっくり一緒にやってみましょう！</p><p data-path-to-node="7">今、パソコンの画面で <b data-path-to-node="7" data-index-in-node="11"><code data-path-to-node="7" data-index-in-node="11">[https://app.netlify.com/drop](https://app.netlify.com/drop)</code></b> というページは開けそうでしょうか？</p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><!----></model-response-content><div _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="response-footer complete gap"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted" style=""><overview-carousel _nghost-ng-c4253567441="" class="lm-enabled ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4253567441="" jslog="268370;track:generic_click,impression"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></overview-carousel><!----></sources-list><!----><election-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c2531033441="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="display: none;"><!----></election-info-disclaimer><finance-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c1136367074="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="display: none;"><!----></finance-info-disclaimer><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c746442083="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c543715647-133 ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c1357127