  <span class="hljs-attr">"name"</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"介護パートナーサポート"</span>,
  <span class="hljs-attr">"short_name"</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"介護パートナー"</span>,
  <span class="hljs-attr">"description"</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"毎日の介護記録や申し送り、介護者のメンタルケアをサポートするアプリ"</span>,
  <span class="hljs-attr">"start_url"</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"./index.html"</span>,
  <span class="hljs-attr">"display"</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"standalone"</span>,
  <span class="hljs-attr">"background_color"</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"#FFECD2"</span>,
  <span class="hljs-attr">"theme_color"</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"#FF7E5F"</span>,
  <span class="hljs-attr">"icons"</span>: [
    {
      <span class="hljs-attr">"src"</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/3063/3063822.png"</span>,
      <span class="hljs-attr">"sizes"</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"192x192"</span>,
      <span class="hljs-attr">"type"</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"image/png"</span>
    },
    {
      <span class="hljs-attr">"src"</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/3063/3063822.png"</span>,
      <span class="hljs-attr">"sizes"</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"512x512"</span>,
      <span class="hljs-attr">"type"</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"image/png"</span>
    }
  ]
}
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><ol start="3" data-path-to-node="7"><li><p data-path-to-node="7,0,0">メモ帳の左上 <b data-path-to-node="7,0,0" data-index-in-node="7">「ファイル」 ➔ 「名前を付けて保存」</b> を押します。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,1,0">保存の設定を次のようにします：</p><ul data-path-to-node="7,1,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="7,1,1,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">ファイル名</b>: <code data-path-to-node="7,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="7">manifest.json</code></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,1,1,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,1,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">ファイルの種類</b>: 「すべてのファイル (<i data-path-to-node="7,1,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="20">.</i>)」を選ぶ</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,1,1,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,1,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">文字コード</b>: <b data-path-to-node="7,1,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="7">「UTF-8」</b> を選ぶ</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">「保存」</b> ボタンを押します。</p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="9">これでパソコンの中に、以下の <b data-path-to-node="9" data-index-in-node="15">2つのファイル</b> ができあがります！</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="10"><li><p data-path-to-node="10,0,0">📄 <b data-path-to-node="10,0,0" data-index-in-node="3"><code data-path-to-node="10,0,0" data-index-in-node="3">index.html</code></b> （Chromeアイコン・開くとホームページが出る）</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="10,1,0">📄 <b data-path-to-node="10,1,0" data-index-in-node="3"><code data-path-to-node="10,1,0" data-index-in-node="3">manifest.json</code></b> （メモ帳アイコン・アプリの設定ファイル）</p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="11">この <b data-path-to-node="11" data-index-in-node="3">2つのファイルを一緒に選択</b> して、GitHubの画面にドロップすれば完了です！</p><p data-path-to-node="12"><code data-path-to-node="12" data-index-in-node="0">manifest.json</code> の保存はうまくできそうでしょうか？</p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><!----></model-response-content><div _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="response-footer complete gap"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-list><!----><election-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c2531033441="" style="display: none;" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></election-info-disclaimer><finance-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c1136367074="" style="display: none;" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></finance-info-disclaimer><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c746442083="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c543715647-20 ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" footer="" class="hide-on-print ng-tns-c3896640774-21 hide-action-bar ng-tns-c543715647-20 ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c3896640774=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c3896640774="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c3896640774-21"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3896640774="" class="buttons-container-v2 ng-tns-c3896640774-21 ng-star-inserted"><!----><action-bar-buttons _ngcontent-ng-c3896640774="" _nghost-ng-c1559823796="" class="ng-tns-c3896640774-21 ng-star-inserted"><copy-button _ngconten