<!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></user-query-content></span></user-query><!----><!----><!----><model-response _ngcontent-ng-c1725488290="" _nghost-ng-c1357127206="" class="enable-lr26-response-chrome-updates ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206=""><response-container _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c543715647="" class="ng-tns-c543715647-22 reduced-bottom-padding enable-lr26-response-chrome-updates enable-luminous-sources ng-star-inserted" jslog="188576;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl80YTM1ZDUyODk5NmQ1MmU3IiwiY185MjE5MDhjNGM5YzIwMzhmIixudWxsLG51bGwsbnVsbCxudWxsLG51bGwsbnVsbCwxLG51bGwsbnVsbCxudWxsLDBdXQ==;mutable:true" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQoMELahcKEwjEs8Xqy_eWAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQUg"><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container response-container-with-gpi ng-tns-c543715647-22 no-background" jslog="173900;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="1"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-header ng-tns-c543715647-22 ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-header-controls ng-tns-c543715647-22"><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="ng-tns-c543715647-22 tts ng-trigger ng-trigger-singleResponseEnter ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="single-draft-response-container ng-tns-c543715647-22"><!----></div></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-header-status ng-tns-c543715647-22"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-header-processing-state ng-tns-c543715647-22"></div></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="presented-response-container ng-tns-c543715647-22" jslog="283401;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="2"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c543715647-22"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" highlighttoaskhost="" class="response-content ng-tns-c543715647-22"><!----><!----><thinking-overlay _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c2753012568="" class="enable-luminous-fast-follows ng-star-inserted"><!----></thinking-overlay><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="model-response-label-announcer" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off"><!----><!----><h6 _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted">Gemini の回答</h6><!----><!----></div><model-response-content _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c652860866=""><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c652860866="" class="model-response-text processing-state-visible ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c2289268078="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2289268078="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c2289268078="" _nghost-ng-c1066623981="" id="message-content-id-r_4a35d528996d52e7" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1066623981="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger" id="model-response-message-contentr_4a35d528996d52e7" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration:400ms; --fade-animation-function:ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0">内容の確認ありがとうございます！コードの内容は完璧です！</p><p data-path-to-node="1">そのテキストをメモ帳に貼り付けて <b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="17"><code data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="17">manifest.json</code></b> として保存すればOKです。</p><h3 data-path-to-node="3">💾 メモ帳での保存手順（確認用）</h3><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="4"><li><p data-path-to-node="4,0,0">今お送りいただいたテキストをすべてコピーして、新規の<b data-path-to-node="4,0,0" data-index-in-node="26">メモ帳</b>に貼り付けます。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="4,1,0">左上の <b data-path-to-node="4,1,0" data-index-in-node="4">「ファイル」 ➔ 「名前を付けて保存」</b> をクリックします。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="4,2,0">以下のように設定して保存します：</p><ul data-path-to-node="4,2,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="4,2,1,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="4,2,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">ファイル名</b>: <code data-path-to-node="4,2,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="7">manifest.json</code></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="4,2,1,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="4,2,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">ファイルの種類</b>: 「すべてのファイル (<i data-path-to-node="4,2,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="20">.</i>)」を選択</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="4,2,1,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="4,2,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">文字コード</b>: <b data-path-to-node="4,2,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="7">「UTF-8」</b> を選択</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="4,3,0"><b data-path-to-node="4,3,0" data-index-in-node="0">「保存」</b> ボタンを押します。</p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="6">これで、アップロードに必要な2つのファイルが準備できました！</p><ul data-path-to-node="7"><li><p data-path-to-node="7,0,0">📄 <b data-path-to-node="7,0,0" data-index-in-node="3"><code data-path-to-node="7,0,0" data-index-in-node="3">index.html</code></b> （アプリの本体）</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,1,0">📄 <b data-path-to-node="7,1,0" data-index-in-node="3"><code data-path-to-node="7,1,0" data-index-in-node="3">manifest.json</code></b> （今保存した設定ファイル）</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="8">2つとも保存できたら、いよいよGitHubの新しい箱（<code data-path-to-node="8" data-index-in-node="27">care-partner</code>）にこの2つのファイルをドラッグ＆ドロップしてアップロードしてみましょう！</p><p data-path-to-node="9">GitHubの画面で迷うところがあれば、いつでも聞いてくださいね。</p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><!----></model-response-content><div _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="response-footer complete gap"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-list><!----><election-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c2531033441="" style="display: none;" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></election-info-disclaimer><finance-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c135