543715647-50"><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="ng-tns-c543715647-50 tts ng-trigger ng-trigger-singleResponseEnter ng-star-inserted" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="single-draft-response-container ng-tns-c543715647-50"><!----></div></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-header-status ng-tns-c543715647-50"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-header-processing-state ng-tns-c543715647-50"></div></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="presented-response-container ng-tns-c543715647-50" jslog="283401;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="2"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c543715647-50"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" highlighttoaskhost="" class="response-content ng-tns-c543715647-50"><!----><!----><thinking-overlay _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c2753012568="" class="enable-luminous-fast-follows ng-star-inserted"><!----></thinking-overlay><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="model-response-label-announcer" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off"><!----><!----><h6 _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted">Gemini の回答</h6><!----><!----></div><model-response-content _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c652860866=""><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c652860866="" class="model-response-text processing-state-visible ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c2289268078="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2289268078="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c2289268078="" _nghost-ng-c1066623981="" id="message-content-id-r_f52ccfc68f1f2d20" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1066623981="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger" id="model-response-message-contentr_f52ccfc68f1f2d20" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration:400ms; --fade-animation-function:ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0">かしこまりました！日本語でわかりやすく丁寧にご案内しますね。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">「Commit changes」を押してファイル一覧画面に戻った後は、最後の仕上げであるホームページとしての公開設定（GitHub Pages）を行います！</p><div class="attachment-container unknown"><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><sequence class="lm-enabled ng-star-inserted"><div class="sequence-container" jslog="308913;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQse0SahgKEwjEs8Xqy_eWAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ3AE"><div class="sequence-event ng-star-inserted"><div hide-from-message-actions="" class="sequence-event-marker-container hide-from-message-actions"><!----><!----><div class="sequence-event-marker gds-body-s ng-star-inserted">1</div><!----><div class="sequence-event-line ng-star-inserted"></div><!----></div><div class="sequence-event-content"><div hide-from-message-actions="" class="hide-from-message-actions"><div class="sequence-event-title gds-emphasized-body-l">Settings（設定）を開く</div><div class="sequence-event-subtitle gds-extended-caption ng-star-inserted">1分</div><!----></div><div class="sequence-event-description gds-body-l"><span only-show-to-message-actions="" data-test-id="sequence-export-header" class="only-show-to-message-actions" style="display: none;"><strong><!----><!---->1.<!----><!---->Settings（設定）を開く:<!----></strong>1分。<!----><!----></span><structured-node-sequence class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><structured-list class="ng-star-inserted"><ol start="1" class="ng-star-inserted"><li class="ng-star-inserted"><structured-node-sequence class="ng-star-inserted"><structured-text class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><p class="ng-star-inserted">画面の上側にあるメニュー（「Code」「Issues」などが並んでいる場所）から <b>「Settings」</b>（歯車マーク ⚙️）をクリックします。</p><!----><!----></structured-text><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></structured-node-sequence><!----></li><!----></ol><!----><!----></structured-list><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></structured-node-sequence><!----></div></div></div><div class="sequence-event ng-star-inserted"><div hide-from-message-actions="" class="sequence-event-marker-container hide-from-message-actions"><!----><!----><div class="sequence-event-marker gds-body-s ng-star-inserted">2</div><!----><div class="sequence-event-line ng-star-inserted"></div><!----></div><div class="sequence-event-content"><div hide-from-message-actions="" class="hide-from-message-actions"><div class="sequence-event-title gds-emphasized-body-l">Pages（ページズ）設定を開く</div><div class="sequence-event-subtitle gds-extended-caption ng-star-inserted">1分</div><!----></div><div class="sequence-event-description gds-body-l"><span only-show-to-message-actions="" data-test-id="sequence-export-header" class="only-show-to-message-actions" style="display: none;"><strong><!----><!---->2.<!----><!---->Pages（ページズ）設定を開く:<!----></strong>1分。<!----><!----></span><structured-node-sequence class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><structured-list class="ng-star-inserted"><ol start="1" class="ng-star-inserted"><li class="ng-star-inserted"><structured-node-sequence class="ng-star-inserted"><structured-text class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><p class="ng-star-inserted">画面の左側にメニューがずらりと並んでいます。その中から <b>「Pages」</b> を探してクリックします。</p><!----><!----></structured-text><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></structured-node-sequence><!----></li><!----></ol><!----><!----></structured-list><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></structured-node-sequence><!----></div></div></div><div class="sequence-event ng-star-inserted"><div hide-from-message-actions="" class="sequence-event-marker-container hide-from-message-actions"><!----><!----><div class="sequence-event-marker gds-body-s ng-star-inserted">3</div><!----><!----></div><div class="sequence-event-content"><div hide-from-message-actions="" class="hide-from-message-actions"><div class="sequence-event-title gds-emphasized-body-l">公開用ブランチを設定して保存する</div><div class="sequence-event-subtitle gds-extended-caption ng-star-inserted">メイン作業</div><!----></div><div class="sequence-event-description gds-body-l"><span only-show-to-message-actions="" data-test-id="sequence-export-header" class="only-show-to-message-actions" style="display: none;"><strong><!----><!---->3.<!----><!---->公開用ブランチを設定して保存する:<!----></strong>メイン作業。<!----><!----></span><structured-node-sequence class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><structured-list class="ng-star-inserted"><ol start="1" class="ng-star-inserted"><li class="ng-star-inserted"><structured-node-sequence class="ng-star-inserted"><structured-text class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><p class="ng-star-inserted">画面中央の <b>「Build and deployment」</b> という項目の下にある <b>「Branch」</b>（現在は <code>None</code> になっています）をクリックします。</p><!----><!----></structured-text><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></structured-node-sequence><!----></li><li class="ng-star-inserted"><structured-node-sequence class="ng-star-inserted"><structured-text class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><p class="ng-star-inserted">ドロップダウン（選択肢）の中から <b><code>main</code></b>（または <code>master</code>）を選びます。</p><!----><!----></structured-text><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></structured-node-sequence><!----></li><li class="ng-star-inserted"><structured-node-sequence class="ng-star-inserted"><structured-text class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><p class="ng-star-inserted">そのすぐ右隣に現れる <b>「Save」</b>（保存）ボタンを押します。</p><!----><!----></structured-text><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></structured-node-sequence><!----></li><!----></ol><!----><!----></structured-list><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></structured-node-sequence><!----></div></div></div><!----></div></sequence><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></div><p data-path-to-node="5">「Save」ボタンを押した後、<b data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="15">1〜3分ほど待ってから</b>ページの更新（再読み込み）をしてみてください。</p><p data-path-to-node="6">画面の上に緑色の枠で：</p><blockquote data-path-to-node="7"><p data-path-to-node="7,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,0" data-index-in-node="0">Your site is live at <code data-path-to-node="7,0" data-index-in-node="21">[https://Nikkysupport.github.io/care-partner/](https://Nikkysupport.github.io/care-partner/)</code></b></p></blockquote><p data-path-to-node="8">という表示が出ます。そのアドレス（<code data-path-to-node="8" data-index-in-node="17">https://...</code>）をクリックすると、作成された介護パートナーアプリが無事に表示されます！</p><p data-path-to-node="9">「Save」を押すところまで進められそうでしょうか？うまく行かない手順があれば、いつでも教えてくださいね。</p><div class="attachment-container unknown"><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><elicitations class="lm-enabled ng-star-inserted"><!----></elicitations><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></div></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><!----></model-response-content><div _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="response-footer gap complete"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-list><!----><election-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c2531033441="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="display: none;"><!----></election-info-disclaimer><finance-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c1136367074="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="display: none;"><!----></finance-info-disclaimer><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c746442083="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c543715647-50 ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" footer="" class="hide-on-print ng-tns-c3896640774-51 ng-star-inserted hide-action-bar" _nghost-ng-c3896640774="" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c3896640774="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c3896640774-51"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3896640774="" class="buttons-container-v2 ng-tns-c3896640774-51 ng-star-inserted"><!----><actio