715647-53"><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="ng-tns-c543715647-53 tts ng-trigger ng-trigger-singleResponseEnter ng-star-inserted" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="single-draft-response-container ng-tns-c543715647-53"><!----></div></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-header-status ng-tns-c543715647-53"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-header-processing-state ng-tns-c543715647-53"></div></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="presented-response-container ng-tns-c543715647-53" jslog="283401;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="2"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c543715647-53"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" highlighttoaskhost="" class="response-content ng-tns-c543715647-53"><!----><!----><thinking-overlay _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c2753012568="" class="enable-luminous-fast-follows ng-star-inserted"><!----></thinking-overlay><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="model-response-label-announcer" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off"><!----><!----><h6 _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted">Gemini の回答</h6><!----><!----></div><model-response-content _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c652860866=""><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c652860866="" class="model-response-text processing-state-visible ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c2289268078="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2289268078="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c2289268078="" _nghost-ng-c1066623981="" id="message-content-id-r_2e5e0eff51b7ca89" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1066623981="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger" id="model-response-message-contentr_2e5e0eff51b7ca89" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration:400ms; --fade-animation-function:ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0">「uploading an existing file」の画面（ファイルをドロップする画面）ですね！</p><p data-path-to-node="1">その画面でファイルをドロップした後の流れを、<b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="22">すべて日本語の画面表記</b>でご案内します！</p><div class="attachment-container unknown"><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><sequence class="lm-enabled ng-star-inserted"><div class="sequence-container" jslog="308913;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQse0SahgKEwjEs8Xqy_eWAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ-gE"><div class="sequence-event ng-star-inserted"><div hide-from-message-actions="" class="sequence-event-marker-container hide-from-message-actions"><!----><!----><div class="sequence-event-marker gds-body-s ng-star-inserted">1</div><!----><div class="sequence-event-line ng-star-inserted"></div><!----></div><div class="sequence-event-content"><div hide-from-message-actions="" class="hide-from-message-actions"><div class="sequence-event-title gds-emphasized-body-l">ファイルを2つだけドロップする</div><div class="sequence-event-subtitle gds-extended-caption ng-star-inserted">メイン作業</div><!----></div><div class="sequence-event-description gds-body-l"><span only-show-to-message-actions="" data-test-id="sequence-export-header" class="only-show-to-message-actions" style="display: none;"><strong><!----><!---->1.<!----><!---->ファイルを2つだけドロップする:<!----></strong>メイン作業。<!----><!----></span><structured-node-sequence class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><structured-list class="ng-star-inserted"><ol start="1" class="ng-star-inserted"><li class="ng-star-inserted"><structured-node-sequence class="ng-star-inserted"><structured-text class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><p class="ng-star-inserted">パソコンのフォルダを開きます。</p><!----><!----></structured-text><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></structured-node-sequence><!----></li><li class="ng-star-inserted"><structured-node-sequence class="ng-star-inserted"><structured-text class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><p class="ng-star-inserted">準備した <b><code>index.html</code></b> と <b><code>manifest.json</code></b> の <b>2つのファイル</b>をマウスで同時に選びます。</p><!----><!----></structured-text><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></structured-node-sequence><!----></li><li class="ng-star-inserted"><structured-node-sequence class="ng-star-inserted"><structured-text class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><p class="ng-star-inserted">その2つのファイルを、画面中央にある**大きな点線の枠の中へ引っぱって離し（ドロップ）**ます。</p><!----><!----></structured-text><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></structured-node-sequence><!----></li><!----></ol><!----><!----></structured-list><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><structured-text class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><p class="ng-star-inserted"><i>※点線の枠の下に、ファイル名が2つ並んで表示されれば成功です！</i></p><!----><!----></structured-text><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></structured-node-sequence><!----></div></div></div><div class="sequence-event ng-star-inserted"><div hide-from-message-actions="" class="sequence-event-marker-container hide-from-message-actions"><!----><!----><div class="sequence-event-marker gds-body-s ng-star-inserted">2</div><!----><!----></div><div class="sequence-event-content"><div hide-from-message-actions="" class="hide-from-message-actions"><div class="sequence-event-title gds-emphasized-body-l">変更を保存する（コミット）</div><div class="sequence-event-subtitle gds-extended-caption ng-star-inserted">保存</div><!----></div><div class="sequence-event-description gds-body-l"><span only-show-to-message-actions="" data-test-id="sequence-export-header" class="only-show-to-message-actions" style="display: none;"><strong><!----><!---->2.<!----><!---->変更を保存する（コミット）:<!----></strong>保存。<!----><!----></span><structured-node-sequence class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><structured-list class="ng-star-inserted"><ol start="1" class="ng-star-inserted"><li class="ng-star-inserted"><structured-node-sequence class="ng-star-inserted"><structured-text class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><p class="ng-star-inserted">画面の一番下までスクロールします。</p><!----><!----></structured-text><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></structured-node-sequence><!----></li><li class="ng-star-inserted"><structured-node-sequence class="ng-star-inserted"><structured-text class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><p class="ng-star-inserted">緑色のボタン <b>「Commit changes」</b>（変更をコミット）を押します。</p><!----><!----></structured-text><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></structured-node-sequence><!----></li><!----></ol><!----><!----></structured-list><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><structured-text class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><p class="ng-star-inserted"><i>※ファイル一覧の画面に戻り、<code>index.html</code> と <code>manifest.json</code> が表示されればアップロード完了です！</i></p><!----><!----></structured-text><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></structured-node-sequence><!----></div></div></div><!----></div></sequence><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></div><p data-path-to-node="5">「Commit changes」を押してファイル一覧画面に戻ったら、教えてくださいね！
最後の公開設定をご案内します。</p><div class="attachment-container unknown"><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><elicitations class="lm-enabled ng-star-inserted"><!----></elicitations><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></div></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><!----></model-response-content><div _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="response-footer gap complete"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-list><!----><election-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c2531033441="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="display: none;"><!----></election-info-disclaimer><finance-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c1136367074="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="display: none;"><!----></finance-info-disclaimer><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c746442083="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c543715647-53 ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" footer="" class="hide-on-print ng-tns