<div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-header-controls ng-tns-c543715647-67"><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="ng-tns-c543715647-67 tts ng-trigger ng-trigger-singleResponseEnter ng-star-inserted" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="single-draft-response-container ng-tns-c543715647-67"><!----></div></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-header-status ng-tns-c543715647-67"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-header-processing-state ng-tns-c543715647-67"></div></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="presented-response-container ng-tns-c543715647-67" jslog="283401;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="2"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c543715647-67"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" highlighttoaskhost="" class="response-content ng-tns-c543715647-67"><!----><!----><thinking-overlay _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c2753012568="" class="enable-luminous-fast-follows ng-star-inserted"><!----></thinking-overlay><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="model-response-label-announcer" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off"><!----><!----><h6 _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted">Gemini の回答</h6><!----><!----></div><model-response-content _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c652860866=""><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c652860866="" class="model-response-text processing-state-visible ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c2289268078="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2289268078="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c2289268078="" _nghost-ng-c1066623981="" id="message-content-id-r_123b97e7b233792d" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1066623981="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger" id="model-response-message-contentr_123b97e7b233792d" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration:400ms; --fade-animation-function:ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0"><b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="0">はい、そちらで間違いありません！「ページ」を押してください！</b></p><p data-path-to-node="1">日本語表示になっているため、英語の「Pages」がカタカナの「ページ」になっています。</p><h3 data-path-to-node="3">🌐 「ページ」を押したあとの設定手順</h3><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="4"><li><p data-path-to-node="4,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="4,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">「ページ」</b> をクリックします。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="4,1,0">画面中央あたりにある <b data-path-to-node="4,1,0" data-index-in-node="11">「ブランチ」</b>（または Branch）の項目で、<b data-path-to-node="4,1,0" data-index-in-node="34"><code data-path-to-node="4,1,0" data-index-in-node="34">None</code></b> になっている部分をクリックします。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="4,2,0">出てくる選択肢の中から <b data-path-to-node="4,2,0" data-index-in-node="12"><code data-path-to-node="4,2,0" data-index-in-node="12">main</code></b>（または <code data-path-to-node="4,2,0" data-index-in-node="21">master</code>）を選びます。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="4,3,0">その右側にある <b data-path-to-node="4,3,0" data-index-in-node="8">「保存」</b>（または Save）ボタンを押します。</p></li></ol><h3 data-path-to-node="6">🚀 保存を押したら…</h3><p data-path-to-node="7">「保存」ボタンを押してから <b data-path-to-node="7" data-index-in-node="14">1〜3分ほど待ち</b>、ブラウザの更新（再読み込み）を行ってください。</p><p data-path-to-node="8">画面の上に緑色の枠が表示され、アプリの専用アドレスが出現します！</p><blockquote data-path-to-node="9"><p data-path-to-node="9,0"><b data-path-to-node="9,0" data-index-in-node="0"><code data-path-to-node="9,0" data-index-in-node="0">[https://Nikkysupport.github.io/care-partner/](https://Nikkysupport.github.io/care-partner/)</code></b></p></blockquote><p data-path-to-node="10">「保存」を押してアドレスが表示されたか、ぜひ確認してみてくださいね！</p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><!----></model-response-content><div _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="response-footer gap complete"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-list><!----><election-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c2531033441="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="display: none;"><!----></election-info-disclaimer><finance-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c1136367074="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="display: none;"><!----></finance-info-disclaimer><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c746442083="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c543715647-67 ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" footer="" class="hide-on-print ng-tns-c3896640774-68 ng-star-inserted hide-action-bar" _nghost-ng-c3896640774=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c3896640774="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c3896640774-68"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3896640774="" class="buttons-container-v2 ng-tns-c3896640774-68 ng-star-inserted"><!----><action-bar-buttons _ngcontent-ng-c3896640774="" _nghost-ng-c1559823796="" class="ng-tns-c3896640774-68 ng-star-inserted"><copy-button _ngcontent-ng-c1559823796="" _nghost-ng-c3634932602="" class="ng-star-inserted"><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c3634932602="" tabindex="-1" theme="lm" type="onSurface" arialabel="コピー" gemtooltip="回答をコピー" class="mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c1283807370="" aria-describedby="cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-9" cdk-describedby-host="ng-1"><!----><!----><button _ngcontent