9"><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="ng-tns-c543715647-79 tts ng-trigger ng-trigger-singleResponseEnter ng-star-inserted" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="single-draft-response-container ng-tns-c543715647-79"><!----></div></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-header-status ng-tns-c543715647-79"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-header-processing-state ng-tns-c543715647-79"></div></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="presented-response-container ng-tns-c543715647-79" jslog="283401;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="2"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c543715647-79"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" highlighttoaskhost="" class="response-content ng-tns-c543715647-79"><!----><!----><thinking-overlay _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c2753012568="" class="enable-luminous-fast-follows ng-star-inserted"><!----></thinking-overlay><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="model-response-label-announcer" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off"><!----><!----><h6 _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted">Gemini の回答</h6><!----><!----></div><model-response-content _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c652860866=""><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c652860866="" class="model-response-text processing-state-visible ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c2289268078="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2289268078="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c2289268078="" _nghost-ng-c1066623981="" id="message-content-id-r_5169b92aafe605b2" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c1066623981="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger" id="model-response-message-contentr_5169b92aafe605b2" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration:400ms; --fade-animation-function:ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0"><b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="0">はい！「主要」で大正解です！</b></p><p data-path-to-node="1">英語の <code data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="4">main</code>（メイン）が日本語で <b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="19">「主要」</b> と翻訳されています。</p><h3 data-path-to-node="3">🚀 最後の仕上げ手順</h3><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="4"><li><p data-path-to-node="4,0,0">ブランチの選択肢から <b data-path-to-node="4,0,0" data-index-in-node="11">「主要」</b>（または <code data-path-to-node="4,0,0" data-index-in-node="20">main</code>）を選びます。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="4,1,0">その右隣にある <b data-path-to-node="4,1,0" data-index-in-node="8">「保存」</b>（または Save）ボタンを押します。</p></li></ol><h3 data-path-to-node="6">🌐 アドレスの完成確認</h3><p data-path-to-node="7">「保存」を押したら、GitHub側でアプリを公開する処理が始まります。</p><p data-path-to-node="8"><b data-path-to-node="8" data-index-in-node="0">1〜3分ほど待ってから</b>、ブラウザの更新（再読み込み）を行ってください。</p><p data-path-to-node="9">画面の上に緑色の枠が表示され、以下のような<b data-path-to-node="9" data-index-in-node="21">アプリ専用アドレス</b>が登場します！</p><blockquote data-path-to-node="10"><p data-path-to-node="10,0"><b data-path-to-node="10,0" data-index-in-node="0"><code data-path-to-node="10,0" data-index-in-node="0">[https://Nikkysupport.github.io/care-partner/](https://Nikkysupport.github.io/care-partner/)</code></b></p></blockquote><p data-path-to-node="11">保存を押して少し待ってみてくださいね。URLが表示されたらぜひ教えてください！</p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><!----></model-response-content><div _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="response-footer gap complete"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-list><!----><election-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c2531033441="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="display: none;"><!----></election-info-disclaimer><finance-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c1136367074="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="display: none;"><!----></finance-info-disclaimer><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c746442083="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c543715647-79 ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" footer="" class="hide-on-print ng-tns-c3896640774-80 ng-star-inserted hide-action-bar" _nghost-ng-c3896640774=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c3896640774="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c3896640774-80"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3896640774="" class="buttons-container-v2 ng-tns-c3896640774-80 ng-star-inserted"><!----><action-bar-buttons _ngcontent-ng-c3896640774="" _nghost-ng-c1559823796="" class="ng-tns-c3896640774-80 ng-star-inserted"><copy-button _ngcontent-ng-c1559823796="" _nghost-ng-c3634932602="" class="ng-star-inserted"><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c3634932602="" tabindex="-1" theme="lm" type="onSurface" arialabel="コピー" gemtooltip="回答をコピー" class="mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c1283807370="" aria-describedby="cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-9" cdk-describedby-host="ng-1"><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c1283807370="" maticonbutton="" matbadgeposition="after" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-badge mat-unthemed mat-badge-overlap mat-badge-above mat-badge-after mat-badge-small mat-badge-hidden ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-r