ntent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-header-controls ng-tns-c543715647-91"><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="ng-tns-c543715647-91 tts ng-trigger ng-trigger-singleResponseEnter ng-star-inserted" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="single-draft-response-container ng-tns-c543715647-91"><!----></div></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-header-status ng-tns-c543715647-91"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-header-processing-state ng-tns-c543715647-91"></div></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="presented-response-container ng-tns-c543715647-91" jslog="283401;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="2"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c543715647-91"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" highlighttoaskhost="" class="response-content ng-tns-c543715647-91"><!----><!----><thinking-overlay _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c2753012568="" class="enable-luminous-fast-follows ng-star-inserted"><!----></thinking-overlay><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="model-response-label-announcer" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off"><!----><!----><h6 _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted">Gemini の回答</h6><!----><!----></div><model-response-content _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c652860866=""><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c652860866="" class="model-response-text processing-state-visible ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c2289268078="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2289268078="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c2289268078="" _nghost-ng-c1066623981="" id="message-content-id-r_893071a69969549d" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1066623981="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger" id="model-response-message-contentr_893071a69969549d" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration:400ms; --fade-animation-function:ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0"><b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="0">おめでとうございます！無事に公開されましたね！</b></p><p data-path-to-node="1">はい、その通りです！「行く」や「非サイト」のボタンは<b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="26">触らなくて大丈夫</b>です。</p><h3 data-path-to-node="3">🚀 アプリの開き方・動作確認</h3><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="4"><li><p data-path-to-node="4,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="4,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">表示されている URL（<code data-path-to-node="4,0,0" data-index-in-node="12">[https://Nikkysupport.github.io/care-partner/](https://Nikkysupport.github.io/care-partner/)</code>）を直接クリック</b>してください。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="4,1,0">ブラウザの新しいタブで、ご自身が作成した「介護パートナーサポート」の画面が正しく表示されれば、Webサイトとしての公開は<b data-path-to-node="4,1,0" data-index-in-node="60">大成功</b>です！</p></li></ol><h3 data-path-to-node="6">📱 スマホのホーム画面に追加する手順</h3><p data-path-to-node="7">スマホからこの URL にアクセスすれば、ホーム画面にアプリとして追加できます。</p><ul data-path-to-node="8"><li><p data-path-to-node="8,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="8,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">iPhone（Safari）</b></p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="8,0,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="8,0,1,0,0">Safariで URL（<code data-path-to-node="8,0,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="12">[https://Nikkysupport.github.io/care-partner/](https://Nikkysupport.github.io/care-partner/)</code>）を開く</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="8,0,1,1,0">画面下部にある <b data-path-to-node="8,0,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="8">「共有ボタン」</b>（箱から矢印が飛び出しているマーク）をタップ</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="8,0,1,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="8,0,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">「ホーム画面に追加」</b> をタップ</p></li></ol></li><li><p data-path-to-node="8,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="8,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Android（Chrome）</b></p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="8,1,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="8,1,1,0,0">Chromeで URL（<code data-path-to-node="8,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="12">[https://Nikkysupport.github.io/care-partner/](https://Nikkysupport.github.io/care-partner/)</code>）を開く</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="8,1,1,1,0">画面右上の <b data-path-to-node="8,1,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="6">「3点リーダー」</b>（縦の3つの点）をタップ</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="8,1,1,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="8,1,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">「ホーム画面に追加」</b> または <b data-path-to-node="8,1,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="15">「アプリをインストール」</b> をタップ</p></li></ol></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="9">これでスマホのホーム画面にアイコンが設置され、タップするだけでいつでもサクサク起動できるようになります。</p><p data-path-to-node="10">パソコンでもスマホでも、まずは URL をクリックしてアプリ画面が開くか試してみてくださいね！</p><div class="attachment-container unknown"><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><elicitations class="lm-enabled ng-star-inserted"><!----></elicitations><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></div></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><!----></model-response-content><div _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="response-footer gap complete"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-list><!----><election-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c2531033441="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="display: none;"><!----></election-info-discla