" jslog="173924;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl82Njk2NWU1MTI3ODY5YTU1IiwiY185MjE5MDhjNGM5YzIwMzhmIixudWxsLG51bGwsbnVsbCxudWxsLG51bGwsbnVsbCwxLG51bGwsbnVsbCxudWxsLDBdXQ=="><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><gem-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1283807370="" _nghost-ng-c411899103=""><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c411899103="" role="img" class="mat-icon notranslate lm-icon-m lumi-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="edit" data-mat-icon-namespace="lumi-symbols" fonticon="edit"></mat-icon><!----><!----><!----></gem-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></gem-icon-button><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></user-query-content></span></user-query><!----><!----><!----><model-response _ngcontent-ng-c1725488290="" _nghost-ng-c1357127206="" class="enable-lr26-response-chrome-updates ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206=""><response-container _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c543715647="" class="ng-tns-c543715647-201 reduced-bottom-padding enable-lr26-response-chrome-updates enable-luminous-sources ng-star-inserted" jslog="188576;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl82Njk2NWU1MTI3ODY5YTU1IiwiY185MjE5MDhjNGM5YzIwMzhmIixudWxsLG51bGwsbnVsbCxudWxsLG51bGwsbnVsbCwxLG51bGwsbnVsbCxudWxsLDBdXQ==;mutable:true" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQoMELahgKEwjEs8Xqy_eWAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQrgc"><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container response-container-with-gpi ng-tns-c543715647-201 no-background" jslog="173900;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="1"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-header ng-tns-c543715647-201 ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-header-controls ng-tns-c543715647-201"><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="ng-tns-c543715647-201 tts ng-trigger ng-trigger-singleResponseEnter ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="single-draft-response-container ng-tns-c543715647-201"><!----></div></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-header-status ng-tns-c543715647-201"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-header-processing-state ng-tns-c543715647-201"></div></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="presented-response-container ng-tns-c543715647-201" jslog="283401;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="2"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c543715647-201"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" highlighttoaskhost="" class="response-content ng-tns-c543715647-201"><!----><!----><thinking-overlay _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c2753012568="" class="enable-luminous-fast-follows ng-star-inserted"><!----></thinking-overlay><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="model-response-label-announcer" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off"><!----><!----><h6 _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted">Gemini の回答</h6><!----><!----></div><model-response-content _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c652860866=""><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c652860866="" class="model-response-text contains-extensions-response processing-state-visible ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c2289268078="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2289268078="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c2289268078="" _nghost-ng-c1066623981="" id="message-content-id-r_66965e5127869a55" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c1066623981="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger" id="model-response-message-contentr_66965e5127869a55" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration:400ms; --fade-animation-function:ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0">私（Gemini）が一番おすすめしたいのは、「あたたかみがあって一目で役割が伝わるデザイン」です！</p><p data-path-to-node="1">「介護パートナーサポート」という素晴らしいアプリ名に合わせて、以下のようなモチーフのアイコンが特におすすめです。</p><h3 data-path-to-node="3">💡 Geminiのおすすめデザイン3選</h3><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="4"><li><p data-path-to-node="4,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="4,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">「両手で包むハート」マーク（一番おすすめ！）</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="4,0,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="4,0,1,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="4,0,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">理由:</b> 手とハートの組み合わせは、「寄り添う・サポートする・安心感」が直感的に伝わります。スマホのホーム画面に置いてあっても優しく温かい印象になります。</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="4,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="4,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">「握手」や「手を差し伸べる」マーク</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="4,1,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="4,1,1,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="4,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">理由:</b> 「パートナー（相棒・協力）」という言葉にぴったりで、一緒に支え合っている信頼感が表現できます。</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="4,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="4,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">「家 ＋ ハート」または「家 ＋ つなぐ手」マーク</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="4,2,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="4,2,1,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="4,2,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">理由:</b> 在宅介護や地域・家庭でのサポートを連想させやすく、見やすく整理された印象を与えられます。</p></li></ul></li></ol><h3 data-path-to-node="6">🎨 アイコンの色（カラー）のおすすめ</h3><ul data-path-to-node="7"><li><p data-path-to-node="7,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">オレンジ・パステルピンク系:</b> 温かみ、親しみやすさ、優しさ</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">グリーン（若草色・エメラルド）系:</b> 安心感、健康、穏やかさ</p></li></ul><h3 data-path-to-node="9">便利なフリー素材サイト</h3><p data-path-to-node="10">もしアイコン画像を探される場合は、商用利用OKで完全無料で使える以下の有名サイトがおすすめです：</p><ul data-path-to-node="11"><li><p data-path-to-node="11,0,0" id="p-rc_be475f66150cd88b-22"><b data-path-to-node="11,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"><span class="citation-5 citation-end-5">ICOOON MONO（アイコンモノ）:<source-footnote ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c4211434500=""><sup _ngcontent-ng-c4211434500="" class="superscript" data-turn-source-index="1"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span></b> <span class="citation-4 citation-end-4">シンプルで医療・介護系のアイコンも豊富です。<source-footnote ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c4211434500=""><sup _ngcontent-ng-c4211434500="" class="superscript" data-turn-source-index="2"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c2872110962="">   <!----><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c2872110962="" _nghost-ng-c3110763459="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3110763459="" class="source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c3110763459="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button multiple-button ng-star-inserted" aria-label="Icooon Mono、note からの複数の引用のソース詳細を表示します。Enter キーを押すとソース ダイアログが開きます。" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" jslog="262206;track:generic_click;BardVeMetadataKey:"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3110763459="" dir="auto" class="source-label-container gds-body-s ng-star-inserted"><span _ngcontent-ng-c3110763459="" class="source-title" style="max-width: 20ch;">Icooon Mono</span><span _ngcontent-ng-c3110763459="" class="source-count ng-star-inserted">他 1 件</span><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="11,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="11,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">イラストAC / ICON BOX:</b> 柔らかいタッチの可愛いイラストアイコンがたくさんあります。</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="12">今の赤いスクーターも「すぐ駆けつける」感じがあって素敵ですが、もし「もっと介護アプリらしくしたいな」と思った時は、ぜひ <b data-path-to-node="12" data-index-in-node="60">「手」や「ハート」をモチーフにしたデザイン</b> を選んでみてくださいね！</p><div class="attachment-container unknown"><response-element class="no-md" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><elicitations class="lm-enabled ng-star-inserted"><!----></elicitations><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></div></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><!----></model-response-content><div _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="response-footer contains-extensions-response gap complete"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><overview-carousel _nghost-ng-c4253567441="" class="lm-enabled ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4253567441="" jslog="268370;track:generic_click,impression"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></overview-carousel><!----></sources-list><!----><election-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c2531033441="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="display: none;"><!----></election-info-disclaimer><finance-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c1136367074="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="display: none;"><!----></finance-info-disclaimer><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c746442083="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sensitive-memories