543715647="" class="response-container-header-controls ng-tns-c543715647-209"><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="ng-tns-c543715647-209 tts ng-trigger ng-trigger-singleResponseEnter ng-star-inserted" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="single-draft-response-container ng-tns-c543715647-209"><!----></div></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-header-status ng-tns-c543715647-209"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-header-processing-state ng-tns-c543715647-209"></div></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="presented-response-container ng-tns-c543715647-209" jslog="283401;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="2"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c543715647-209"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" highlighttoaskhost="" class="response-content ng-tns-c543715647-209"><!----><!----><thinking-overlay _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c2753012568="" class="enable-luminous-fast-follows ng-star-inserted"><!----></thinking-overlay><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="model-response-label-announcer" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off"><!----><!----><h6 _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted">Gemini の回答</h6><!----><!----></div><model-response-content _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c652860866=""><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c652860866="" class="model-response-text processing-state-visible ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c2289268078="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2289268078="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c2289268078="" _nghost-ng-c1066623981="" id="message-content-id-r_252dae74a9bb8560" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1066623981="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger" id="model-response-message-contentr_252dae74a9bb8560" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration:400ms; --fade-animation-function:ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0">やっぱり <b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="5">「左上（手でハートを包み込むデザイン）」</b> が一番おすすめです！</p><p data-path-to-node="1">私もまさにその左上のアイコンが『介護パートナーサポート』に一番ぴったりだと思っていました。</p><h3 data-path-to-node="3">💡 左上が一番おすすめな理由</h3><ul data-path-to-node="4"><li><p data-path-to-node="4,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="4,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">「包み込む優しさ」が伝わる</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="4,0,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="4,0,1,0,0">手でハートを下からそっと支えている形が、「寄り添ってサポートする」というアプリの目的にとてもよく合っています。</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="4,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="4,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">スマホの画面で見やすい</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="4,1,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="4,1,1,0,0">色使いがシンプルで明るいオレンジなので、小さなアイコンになってもパッと目立ちやすく、探しやすいです。</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="4,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="4,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">二人の「共同制作」にぴったり</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="4,2,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="4,2,1,0,0">一緒に試行錯誤しながら作ったアプリだからこそ、こういう温かみのあるデザインがつくと、開くたびに嬉しくなりますよね！</p></li></ul></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="5">左上のアイコンに決めて、アプリの顔（アイコン）も新しく変えてみましょうか？</p><p data-path-to-node="6">もし変更してみたい場合は、画像を用意して置き換える手順をわかりやすくご案内しますので、いつでも教えてくださいね！</p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><!----></model-response-content><div _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="response-footer gap complete"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-list><!----><election-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c2531033441="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="display: none;"><!----></election-info-disclaimer><finance-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c1136367074="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="display: none;"><!----></finance-info-disclaimer><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c746442083="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c543715647-209 ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" footer="" class="hide-on-print ng-tns-c3896640774-210 ng-star-inserted hide-action-bar" _nghost-ng-c3896640774="" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c3896640774="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c3896640774-210"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3896640774="" class="buttons-container-v2 ng-tns-c3896640774-210 ng-star-inserted"><!----><action-bar-buttons _ngcontent-ng-c3896640774="" _nghost-ng-c1559823796="" class="ng-tns-c3896640774-210 ng-star-inserted"><copy-button _ngcontent-ng-c1559823796="" _nghost-ng-c3634932602="" class="ng-star-inserted"><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c3634932602="" tabindex="-1" theme="lm" type="onSurface" arialabel="コピー" gemtooltip="回答をコピー" class="mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c1283807370="" aria-describedby="cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-9" cdk-describedby-host="ng-1"><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c1283807370="" maticonbutton="" matbadgeposition="after" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-badge mat-unthemed mat-badge-overlap mat-badge-above mat-badge-after mat-badge-small mat-badge-hidden ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" aria-label="コピー" jslog="178035;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl8yNTJkYWU