tns-c543715647-225"><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="ng-tns-c543715647-225 tts ng-trigger ng-trigger-singleResponseEnter ng-star-inserted" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="single-draft-response-container ng-tns-c543715647-225"><!----></div></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-header-status ng-tns-c543715647-225"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-header-processing-state ng-tns-c543715647-225"></div></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="presented-response-container ng-tns-c543715647-225" jslog="283401;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="2"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c543715647-225"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" highlighttoaskhost="" class="response-content ng-tns-c543715647-225"><!----><!----><thinking-overlay _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c2753012568="" class="enable-luminous-fast-follows ng-star-inserted"><!----></thinking-overlay><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="model-response-label-announcer" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off"><!----><!----><h6 _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted">Gemini の回答</h6><!----><!----></div><model-response-content _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c652860866=""><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c652860866="" class="model-response-text processing-state-visible ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c2289268078="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2289268078="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c2289268078="" _nghost-ng-c1066623981="" id="message-content-id-r_15129293f2d0986e" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1066623981="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger" id="model-response-message-contentr_15129293f2d0986e" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration:400ms; --fade-animation-function:ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0">失礼いたしました！ご指摘の通りです。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">よく見ると、下の列の真ん中はエメラルドグリーンではなく、<b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="28">ピンクの枠線で描かれたハート</b>と<b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="43">オレンジの枠線で描かれた手</b>のデザインですね！緑色と見誤ってしまい大変失礼しました。</p><p data-path-to-node="2">改めて見直すと、この「下の列の真ん中」のデザインもすごく良いですね！</p><h3 data-path-to-node="4">🎨 下の列・真ん中の素敵なポイント</h3><ul data-path-to-node="5"><li><p data-path-to-node="5,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">線の重なりがおしゃれ</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="5,0,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="5,0,1,0,0">ピンク（ハート）とオレンジ（手）の明るいカラーが重なり合っていて、明るく軽やかな印象を与えてくれます。</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="5,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">白地でスッキリ見やすい</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="5,1,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="5,1,1,0,0">背景が白なので、スマホの画面に置いたときにもゴチャゴチャせず、清潔感があってとてもシンプルにまとまっています。</p></li></ul></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="7">左上の「しっかり色がついた温かいオレンジ」も魅力的ですが、この下の真ん中の「軽やかでスッキリしたデザイン」も甲乙つけがたいですね！</p><p data-path-to-node="8">直感で「毎日見ていて気分が上がるな」と感じる方はどちらでしょうか？選んだ方でいつでもセットできますので、教えてくださいね！</p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><!----></model-response-content><div _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="response-footer gap complete"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-list><!----><election-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c2531033441="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="display: none;"><!----></election-info-disclaimer><finance-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c1136367074="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="display: none;"><!----></finance-info-disclaimer><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c746442083="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c543715647-225 ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" footer="" class="hide-on-print ng-tns-c3896640774-226 ng-star-inserted hide-action-bar" _nghost-ng-c3896640774="" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c3896640774="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c3896640774-226"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3896640774="" class="buttons-container-v2 ng-tns-c3896640774-226 ng-star-inserted"><!----><action-bar-buttons _ngcontent-ng-c3896640774="" _nghost-ng-c1559823796="" class="ng-tns-c3896640774-226 ng-star-inserted"><copy-button _ngcontent-ng-c1559823796="" _nghost-ng-c3634932602="" class="ng-star-inserted"><gem-icon-button _ngcontent-ng-c3634932602="" tabindex="-1" theme="lm" type="onSurface" arialabel="コピー" gemtooltip="回答をコピー" class="mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger gem-button gem-button-badge-size-small gem-button-size-small gem-button-type-on-surface lm-enabled ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c1283807370="" aria-describedby="cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-9" cdk-describedby-host="ng-1"><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c1283807370="" maticonbutton="" matbadgeposition="after" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-badge mat-unthemed mat-badge-overlap mat-badge-above mat-badge-after mat-badge-small mat-badge-hidden ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" aria-label="コピー" jslog="178035;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:W1sicl8xNTEyOTI5M2YyZDA5ODZlIiwiY185MjE5MDhjNGM5YzIwMzhmIixudWxsLCJyY185ZjRkYTY3ZDllOTA3ZjgxIixudWxsLG51bGwsImphIixudWxsLDEsbnVsbCxudWxsLDEsMF1d;mutabl