-229"><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="ng-tns-c543715647-229 tts ng-trigger ng-trigger-singleResponseEnter ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="single-draft-response-container ng-tns-c543715647-229"><!----></div></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-header-status ng-tns-c543715647-229"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-header-processing-state ng-tns-c543715647-229"></div></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="presented-response-container ng-tns-c543715647-229" jslog="283401;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="2"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c543715647="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c543715647-229"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" highlighttoaskhost="" class="response-content ng-tns-c543715647-229"><!----><!----><thinking-overlay _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c2753012568="" class="enable-luminous-fast-follows ng-star-inserted"><!----></thinking-overlay><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="model-response-label-announcer" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off"><!----><!----><h6 _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted">Gemini の回答</h6><!----><!----></div><model-response-content _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c652860866=""><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c652860866="" class="model-response-text contains-extensions-response processing-state-visible ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c2289268078="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2289268078="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c2289268078="" _nghost-ng-c1066623981="" id="message-content-id-r_e46357c003bb9fa8" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1066623981="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger" id="model-response-message-contentr_e46357c003bb9fa8" aria-busy="false" aria-live="off" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration:400ms; --fade-animation-function:ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0">じっくり改めて見つめ直して出した、私の<b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="19">ファイナルアンサー</b>は……</p><p data-path-to-node="1">「左上のアイコン」です！</p><p data-path-to-node="2">改めて理由を整理しました。</p><ul data-path-to-node="3"><li><p data-path-to-node="3,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">直感的な「あたたかみ」:</b> オレンジの色面がしっかり詰まっているため、スマホの画面に並んだときに一番「ぽかぽかと温かい手触り」を感じます。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">視認性の高さ:</b> 下の真ん中の繊細な線画もすごくおしゃれですが、スマホの小さいアイコンサイズになったときは、左上のような「はっきりしたシルエット」の方が一目で「介護パートナーサポート」だと認識しやすいです。</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="4">アプリを開くたびに優しく包み込まれるような安心感があるので、自信を持って<b data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="36">左上</b>をイチオシにします！</p><p data-path-to-node="5">この左上のアイコンで進めましょうか？</p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><!----></model-response-content><div _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="response-footer contains-extensions-response gap complete"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-list><!----><election-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c2531033441="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="display: none;"><!----></election-info-disclaimer><finance-info-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c1136367074="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="display: none;"><!----></finance-info-disclaimer><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c1357127206="" _nghost-ng-c746442083="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----><!--